{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>\n\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0708/c434e9f1c17d58d.webp\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0708/49dcda3a7d745a7.webp\"/>\n</p>\n<p>除此之外，董宇輝還曬出在鳥巢現場觀看周杰倫「龍拳・北京嘉年華」演唱會現場視頻。</p>\n<p>據悉，這並非董宇輝首次分享與周杰倫的合影。2025年4月，他曾發佈過一張二人合照。2024年周杰倫演唱會現場，董宇輝專程到場觀演，二人還曾一同錄製綜藝《週遊記》。</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0708/8a5f106825caf25.webp\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0708/c434e9f1c17d58d.webp\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0708/49dcda3a7d745a7.webp\"/>\n</p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-08T00:38:51.682534+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":5,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"unknown"}}